  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span> </a></span>has released the Answer Key for the recruitment of Lekhpal Posts on the official website of UPSSSC. This recruitment has been issued for 7994 posts. The Examination will going to Conducted on 21 May 2026. Online registration process for UPSSSC Lekhpal Recruitment 2026 were Accepted 29 December 2025 to 28 January 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for UPSSSC Lekhpal Answer Key 2026 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Lekhpal Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Lekhpal Advt No 02 Exam 2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>29&nbsp;December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>28 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>28 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>04 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Eligibility Result : <strong>26 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date&nbsp;:<b> 21 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details :<b> 11 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available&nbsp;<b>: 16 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>22 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, Candidates : <strong>Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH Candidates:<strong> Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">Mains Exam Fees&nbsp;</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, Candidates : <strong>Rs. 80/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH Candidates :<strong> 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Lekhpal Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC Lekhpal Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Lekhpal </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 7994 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 43.1559%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 43.1559%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lekhpal</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">4165</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">792</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1441</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1446</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">150</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSSSC Lekhpal Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates should have UPSSSC PET 2025 Score Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have passed <strong>10+2 (Intermediate)</strong> or equivalent from any recognized board&nbsp; will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UPSSSC Lekhpal Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then click on the Download Answer Key link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">The candidate can also download their Answer Key download from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Lekhpal Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Based On PET Score Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\