 the UPSSSC Lekhpal Answer Key 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You can download it from the official UPSSSC website – <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\">upsssc.gov.in</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What details are required to download the Answer Key ?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You will need your&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"765\">Registration Number</strong>,&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"790\">Date of Birth (DOB)</strong>, and a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"814\">Captcha Code</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><strong>Q. What is UPPSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of UPSSSC is https://upsssc.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
